# This file exists to keep the cert/ directory tracked in source control even when
# no .pfx files are present (the .pfx files themselves are gitignored).
#
# Place runtime/SPP client-credential certificates here. Filenames are referenced by
# SaaSApiConfiguration:MTCertPath and (future) SaaSApiConfiguration:RuntimeAppCertPath
# in App Service Configuration. The CustomerSite.csproj is configured to copy this
# folder (including the .pfx) to publish output, so a local Publish.ps1 picks the
# cert up automatically.
#
# CI builds without the .pfx present will produce a publish output WITHOUT the cert.
# That's intentional -- avoid checking the .pfx into source control. Deploy locally
# from a workstation that has the .pfx, or arrange a secure CI-time injection.
